<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: castle door (medium) -->
  <VFEM2_2x1CastleDoor.label>城堡大门</VFEM2_2x1CastleDoor.label>
  <!-- EN: An incredibly resistant door made out of oversized stone blocks. Very slow to build. It’s a good choice if you want to keep the enemies out - or in. The door requires walls on either side to function. -->
  <VFEM2_2x1CastleDoor.description>用大块石材制造出来的大门，防御性很强。建造速度很慢。非常适合用来阻隔敌人。需要两边连接到墙上才能使用。</VFEM2_2x1CastleDoor.description>
  
  <!-- EN: castle gate (medium) -->
  <VFEM2_2x1CastleGate.label>城堡闸门</VFEM2_2x1CastleGate.label>
  <!-- EN: An incredibly resistant door made out of oversized stone blocks, with a latticed grille protecting the passage. Very slow to build. It’s a good choice if you want to keep the enemies out - or in. The door requires walls on either side to function. Castle gates take a long time to open. -->
  <VFEM2_2x1CastleGate.description>用大块石材制造出来的大门，防御性很强。门板是一面栅格结构的闸门。建造速度很慢。非常适合用来阻隔敌人。需要两边连接到墙上才能使用。</VFEM2_2x1CastleGate.description>
  
